Create file on windows CMD : notepad sample-pod.yaml

list the content : dir *.yaml  
dir sample-pod.yaml     :: check a specific file
dir *.yaml              :: list only YAML files
dir /a                  :: include hidden files
dir /b                  :: names only, no extra details
dir /s                  :: include subfolders

apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: nginx
spec:
  containers:
  - name: nginx
    image: nginx:1.14.2
    ports:
    - containerPort: 80

C:\Users\Admin\.azure-kubectl>notepad sample-pod.yaml

